  <ScenTitle>Memphis Goes North, 1981</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;In 1981, SSN 691 &lt;EM&gt;Memphis&lt;/EM&gt; completed an around-the-world cruise.&amp;nbsp; This scenario assumes that during this time&amp;nbsp;she was called upon to assist in the completion of a covert mission.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
